WEBVTT

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:03.690
On your marks!

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:05.420
Get set!

00:00:14.990 --> 00:00:17.070
Whoa, Midorikawa's fast!

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:42.890
Man, Nao. I'm no match for ya!

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:45.810
Well, all that soccer's got to be good for something.

00:00:45.810 --> 00:00:48.630
You'll be a certain pick for the girls' relay, Nao.

00:00:49.010 --> 00:00:50.200
Girls' relay?

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:53.560
It's the biggest event of the Athletic Festival! Which is, what, next week?

00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:57.010
Oh! Good luck then, Nao-chan!

00:00:57.950 --> 00:01:02.690
Hey now... I like running, sure, but competition really isn't my thing.

00:01:02.690 --> 00:01:05.350
Aww! But you'd be so good!

00:01:09.890 --> 00:01:11.460
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:13.290
Smile Precure!

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:14.190
Let's go!

00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:15.730
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:15.730 --> 00:01:16.860
All together!

00:01:17.090 --> 00:01:18.460
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:01:18.460 --> 00:01:20.670
Jump to tomorrow!

00:01:20.870 --> 00:01:23.370
Smile Precure!

00:01:25.200 --> 00:01:28.170
Smile! Smile! Smile Precure!

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:33.610
A smile, shining like the sun.

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:38.820
We all carry an undying sparkle.

00:01:39.550 --> 00:01:44.760
Keep going with all you've got, girls!

00:01:45.120 --> 00:01:49.690
Those beads of sweat are diamonds.

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:49.660
So bright!

00:01:49.690 --> 00:01:54.870
The future that you'll shine the way to

00:01:55.230 --> 00:02:01.310
When you five lights seize the will to win.

00:01:59.270 --> 00:02:01.810
Happy! Sunny! Peace! March! Beauty!

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:02.970
Let's go!

00:02:02.970 --> 00:02:05.680
(Smile! Smile!) The power of a smile

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:08.610
(Smile! Smile!) Joins us all together.

00:02:08.950 --> 00:02:13.420
We'll never let a friend cry!

00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:13.980
Girls! Let's go!

00:02:14.050 --> 00:02:15.650
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:16.790
Everybody!

00:02:16.820 --> 00:02:18.460
Smile! Smile! Precure!

00:02:18.460 --> 00:02:20.990
Fly to the future!

00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:24.500
Sparkle! Smile Precure!

00:02:25.260 --> 00:02:26.660
Smile! Smile! Smile! Smile!

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:28.970
Smile Precure!

00:02:33.310 --> 00:02:35.380
The next event is the girls' relay.

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:38.140
Would anyone like to nominate themselves?

00:02:38.140 --> 00:02:39.600
Nao-chan~

00:02:39.600 --> 00:02:40.390
Nao!

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:47.400
The relay, huh? Class 1 and 4's teams are all in the Track and Field Club.

00:02:47.400 --> 00:02:48.740
They're unbeatable!

00:02:48.740 --> 00:02:52.470
Yeah, no point trying. We wouldn't stand a chance.

00:02:52.870 --> 00:02:54.070
We wouldn't?

00:02:52.910 --> 00:02:55.910
Maybe we should just pass?

00:02:55.910 --> 00:02:57.560
It's not like we can win or anything.

00:02:57.560 --> 00:02:59.540
We'd just be goin' out to lose.

00:02:59.540 --> 00:03:01.540
We'd lose before we'd even started!

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:01.880
Please, everyone...

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:03.610
I'll do it!

00:03:03.910 --> 00:03:04.800
Alright!

00:03:04.800 --> 00:03:05.340
Nao-chan!

00:03:05.720 --> 00:03:07.980
Hey, Midorikawa, huh? That might work.

00:03:07.980 --> 00:03:09.510
Yeah, but what about the rest?

00:03:09.510 --> 00:03:11.660
One fast runner can't win a relay!

00:03:11.660 --> 00:03:12.780
Yeah...

00:03:12.780 --> 00:03:18.420
Our relay team will be me, Hoshizora-san, Hino-san, Kise-san, and Aoki-san.

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:26.330
Leave it to us!

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:39.620
Club plus oni equals double strong!

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:42.150
There's an oni waiting around every corner!

00:03:43.730 --> 00:03:49.250
Oh? Where are Wolfrun-san and Majorina-san, may I ask?

00:03:49.250 --> 00:03:54.260
I was hoping the three of you could work together and wrangle us up some lovely Bad Energy...

00:03:55.260 --> 00:03:57.260
Work together?

00:03:58.060 --> 00:04:00.960
Working together's for wimps-oni!

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:04.640
I can handle this myself-oni!

00:04:04.970 --> 00:04:06.540
Fight!

00:04:12.110 --> 00:04:13.480
Miyuki!

00:04:13.480 --> 00:04:14.280
Right!

00:04:16.520 --> 00:04:17.450
The heck are you doin'?!

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:22.910
Long, purposeful strides! Wide, forceful arms!

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:26.420
Long, purposeful strides! Wide, forceful arms!

00:04:26.430 --> 00:04:28.360
Uh, Reika? Move forward, maybe?

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:29.360
Oh, no!

00:04:39.910 --> 00:04:41.460
Whoa...

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:43.710
That's class 1's relay team.

00:04:43.710 --> 00:04:47.380
The Track and Field Club do live up to their reputation, do they not?

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:49.760
Wow they're fast.

00:04:50.250 --> 00:04:54.590
But, you know. Whoever we're up against, we'll just have to run our own race.

00:04:54.990 --> 00:04:55.790
Indeed.

00:04:55.790 --> 00:04:57.770
Yeah! I'll give it 110%!

00:04:57.770 --> 00:05:01.670
Yeah... and besides, we've got Nao-chan on our side!

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:03.730
Right! GoPrecure's invincible!

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:09.600
So, I think we should have Akane lead, get us off to a strong start.

00:05:09.600 --> 00:05:11.110
You got it! Leave it to me!

00:05:11.110 --> 00:05:13.010
Miyuki-chan, you need to practice with that baton.

00:05:13.170 --> 00:05:15.980
Right! I'll make sure I don't drop it.

00:05:17.070 --> 00:05:19.850
Reika, you need to stop over-thinking and let your body do the work.

00:05:19.850 --> 00:05:20.950
Very well.

00:05:21.270 --> 00:05:23.920
And Yayoi-chan, you just need to practice running for a bit.

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:29.390
I... really don't think I should be on the relay team.

00:05:31.490 --> 00:05:34.790
I'm just going to hold you all back...

00:05:34.790 --> 00:05:36.720
What're you talkin' about?

00:05:36.730 --> 00:05:42.500
I've never been any good at sports and stuff, even back in elementary school...

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:44.320
I'm not going to suddenly...

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:47.570
Don't think about winning or losing.

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:48.880
But...

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:51.070
Just give it your best!

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:57.510
You'd be much faster if you picked someone else though...

00:05:58.230 --> 00:06:00.820
Why me, Nao-chan...?

00:06:09.420 --> 00:06:13.400
I'm sorry... I guess it was a bit selfish of me to rope you all in.

00:06:15.300 --> 00:06:18.600
I just… want to run the race with you guys!

00:06:19.970 --> 00:06:22.710
Just the five of us, together!

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:28.050
Nao-chan...

00:06:28.050 --> 00:06:29.550
Don't forget about me-kuru!

00:06:30.550 --> 00:06:32.320
You're included, of course!

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:33.970
Kuru.

00:06:35.830 --> 00:06:38.220
All right, we'll be training every morning from now on, okay?

00:06:38.220 --> 00:06:39.240
Bye bye!

00:06:39.240 --> 00:06:40.730
Bye bye!

00:06:43.270 --> 00:06:45.200
Ya-yo-i!

00:06:45.730 --> 00:06:47.050
Just give it your best!

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:50.900
Yeah! Don't worry about winning, just have fun out there!

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:54.370
Okay... I'll do my best!

00:06:54.370 --> 00:06:56.310
Me too!

00:06:56.310 --> 00:06:59.080
A'ight! Let's rock this thing!

00:06:59.080 --> 00:07:00.020
Ready!

00:07:00.020 --> 00:07:01.050
Here-kuru!

00:07:01.050 --> 00:07:01.640
Here-kuru!

00:07:01.640 --> 00:07:02.050
Ready!

00:07:02.410 --> 00:07:02.940
Ready!

00:07:02.940 --> 00:07:04.150
Here-kuru!

00:07:04.150 --> 00:07:05.780
How was that, Coach?

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:07.790
Very well done-kuru!

00:07:09.290 --> 00:07:11.270
And now, your reward-kuru!

00:07:11.270 --> 00:07:13.230
Use the Sports Décor-kuru!

00:07:13.390 --> 00:07:14.670
Okay, Coach!

00:07:14.670 --> 00:07:17.270
Let's go: Sports!

00:07:17.270 --> 00:07:19.870
Alright! I got a gold medal!

00:07:20.510 --> 00:07:23.130
Are you excited for the relay, Miyuki-kuru?

00:07:23.130 --> 00:07:26.070
Yeah! I can't wait!

00:07:26.260 --> 00:07:28.840
We can do it, Class 2-2!

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:31.220
Yeah!

00:07:36.940 --> 00:07:38.750
Hey!

00:07:38.750 --> 00:07:40.650
Good morning!

00:07:40.870 --> 00:07:42.280
Good morning!

00:07:42.280 --> 00:07:45.290
All right, let's get fired up!

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:48.260
Long, purposeful strides! Wide, forceful arms!

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:51.590
Alright, let's go!

00:07:51.590 --> 00:07:53.210
Reika! Move forward!

00:07:53.210 --> 00:07:53.970
Ah!

00:08:28.180 --> 00:08:29.470
You've gotten faster again!

00:08:29.680 --> 00:08:30.840
Good going, Yayoi-chan!

00:08:31.090 --> 00:08:32.720
Alright!

00:08:39.590 --> 00:08:40.980
Tomorrow's the big day, huh.

00:08:40.980 --> 00:08:43.020
Kinda nerve-wrackin'!

00:08:43.820 --> 00:08:46.170
Geez, Akane-chan!

00:08:47.450 --> 00:08:50.480
Oh, I left something back in the classroom.

00:08:50.480 --> 00:08:52.420
Sorry, go on without me!

00:08:53.570 --> 00:08:55.490
We'll wait by the gate!

00:09:00.630 --> 00:09:02.470
I'm really worried about the relay...

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:04.210
Seriously. Why Kise of all people?

00:09:04.210 --> 00:09:05.700
We're gonna lose for sure now.

00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:07.600
I mean, she's been training...

00:09:07.600 --> 00:09:09.940
But what's the point if we're gonna lose?

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:11.940
Maybe a miracle will happen...

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:13.570
Why don't you do it, then?

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:15.950
I would if I could, man! I'd tear that up!

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:18.280
Well, you've got the boys' relay instead.

00:09:18.280 --> 00:09:20.550
Yup! Gonna blitz that race, man!

00:09:21.060 --> 00:09:23.500
Yayoi-san has been gone an awful long time, hasn't she...

00:09:23.880 --> 00:09:25.430
Ah, it's Yayoi-chan!

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:26.380
Yayoi!

00:09:26.380 --> 00:09:30.580
Where have you been, Yayoi-kuru? We've been waiting-kuru!

00:09:33.830 --> 00:09:35.190
Sorry, everyone...

00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:37.150
Come on, Yayoi-chan!

00:09:37.150 --> 00:09:41.140
Remember, eat a big dinner tonight! Ya gotta build your energy!

00:09:41.180 --> 00:09:42.420
Kuru kuru!

00:09:46.490 --> 00:09:51.950
I'm going to gather up a ton of Bad Energy from these humans!

00:09:56.410 --> 00:09:57.670
March!

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:04.650
Candy!

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:24.770
Let's go! Let's go!

00:10:24.770 --> 00:10:28.470
Let's go! Let's go!

00:10:28.470 --> 00:10:33.670
The second-year inter-class girls' relay is about to begin.

00:10:33.670 --> 00:10:36.970
Would the runners please assemble at the track.

00:10:35.010 --> 00:10:37.370
The relay! That's us!

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:39.440
Alright! Finally!

00:10:39.440 --> 00:10:41.370
Man, I'm so nervous...

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:43.550
Relax, relax!

00:10:47.350 --> 00:10:48.770
Fight!

00:10:49.900 --> 00:10:51.590
I've got butterflies...

00:10:51.590 --> 00:10:53.320
Taking some deep breaths should help.

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:06.600
Yayoi-chan?

00:11:06.600 --> 00:11:08.520
Nao-chan, I really don't think I can...

00:11:11.680 --> 00:11:12.470
Listen up!

00:11:13.840 --> 00:11:17.750
What's important right now, is that our hearts connect through passing this baton.

00:11:17.750 --> 00:11:21.250
All we have to do is work together, and run as best as we can!

00:11:21.470 --> 00:11:22.330
Right!

00:11:22.330 --> 00:11:23.800
Of course.

00:11:26.590 --> 00:11:29.990
Work together? Don't give me that garbage-oni!

00:11:31.500 --> 00:11:33.400
Working together is stupid-oni!

00:11:33.910 --> 00:11:35.300
It's Akaoni-kuru!

00:11:35.800 --> 00:11:40.500
I'm strong enough on my own, without anyone's help-oni!

00:11:41.170 --> 00:11:44.210
This world will be stained with the worst possible conclusion...

00:11:44.210 --> 00:11:46.720
a Bad End-oni!

00:11:47.480 --> 00:11:51.310
The blank slate of your future will be clouded in darkness-oni!

00:11:58.030 --> 00:12:05.280
The Bad Energy we gather from the humans will resurrect the Emperor of Darkness, King Pierrot{-sama}-oni!

00:12:09.730 --> 00:12:12.350
Come on out, Akanbe!

00:12:14.930 --> 00:12:17.340
Akanbe!

00:12:18.010 --> 00:12:20.340
We're not going to let you ruin our Athletic Festival!

00:12:20.580 --> 00:12:21.930
Come on!

00:12:21.930 --> 00:12:22.780
Right!

00:12:26.520 --> 00:12:27.800
Ready?

00:12:28.300 --> 00:12:31.160
Precure, Smile Charge!

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:32.290
Go!

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:34.920
Go, go!

00:12:34.920 --> 00:12:36.510
Let's go!

00:13:04.610 --> 00:13:07.750
The light of the future, shining bright!

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:10.750
Cure Happy!

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:15.530
Dazzling sun!

00:13:15.530 --> 00:13:17.520
Hot-blooded power!

00:13:18.470 --> 00:13:20.000
Cure Sunny!

00:13:22.680 --> 00:13:25.820
Rock, paper, scissors! Sparkling bright...

00:13:27.220 --> 00:13:28.990
Cure Peace!

00:13:30.980 --> 00:13:34.530
Laying down the gauntlet, with courage blazing!

00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:37.530
Cure March!

00:13:39.930 --> 00:13:43.640
A gentle heart as pure as the driven snow...

00:13:44.680 --> 00:13:46.510
Cure Beauty!

00:13:48.090 --> 00:13:51.000
Our five lights will blaze a path to the future!

00:13:56.920 --> 00:14:01.380
Shining bright, Smile Precure!

00:14:03.330 --> 00:14:05.210
That's more like it, Precure!

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:06.080
Akanbe!

00:14:06.080 --> 00:14:08.580
Akanbe!

00:14:12.960 --> 00:14:14.720
Akanbe!

00:14:18.590 --> 00:14:20.700
Akanbe!

00:14:22.310 --> 00:14:25.570
We've gotta use Rainbow Healing, or this'll go on forever...

00:14:28.030 --> 00:14:30.220
Like I'll give you the chance-oni!

00:14:30.220 --> 00:14:33.080
See, even together, the five of you are weak-oni!

00:14:36.180 --> 00:14:39.380
Akanbe...

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:43.280
March!

00:14:45.470 --> 00:14:50.850
Come on! Let's go! Let's go!

00:14:50.860 --> 00:14:54.760
Let... go! Let go!

00:14:54.760 --> 00:14:55.600
Don't do that!

00:14:55.600 --> 00:14:57.300
Akanbe!

00:15:02.900 --> 00:15:04.340
March!

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:08.180
Just give up already-oni!

00:15:08.180 --> 00:15:11.910
You don't stand a chance, no matter how hard you try-oni!

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:14.620
We <i>what</i>?

00:15:14.870 --> 00:15:18.670
Work together all you want! A group of weaklings is still weak-oni!

00:15:18.670 --> 00:15:23.930
That's why I work alone-oni! I don't need anyone holding me back-oni!

00:15:23.930 --> 00:15:25.130
You're wrong!

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:25.990
Oni?!

00:15:26.690 --> 00:15:30.510
There are things you can only achieve by working together!

00:15:30.510 --> 00:15:34.440
I'll give everything my best shot...

00:15:34.440 --> 00:15:37.070
...and I will never accept defeat before I even start!

00:15:38.040 --> 00:15:43.900
Running the relay, being a Precure... I want to do them because of the people I'm with!

00:15:43.900 --> 00:15:49.220
And if we work together, then nothing... Nothing is impossible!

00:15:50.640 --> 00:15:53.280
If we work... together...

00:15:55.090 --> 00:15:57.810
Yeah, March's right!

00:15:57.810 --> 00:16:00.490
If we combine our strengths...

00:16:00.490 --> 00:16:04.050
There's no way we'll lose!

00:16:04.820 --> 00:16:07.940
Akanbe!

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:10.940
But that's impossible-oni!

00:16:11.440 --> 00:16:17.050
Now, combine your powers-kuru!

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:23.500
Let's go!

00:16:31.860 --> 00:16:33.240
Precure...

00:16:35.940 --> 00:16:38.610
Rainbow...

00:16:38.610 --> 00:16:40.320
Healing!

00:16:42.920 --> 00:16:45.840
Akanbe...

00:16:54.510 --> 00:16:56.550
Say, Nao-chan... let's all...

00:16:57.320 --> 00:17:00.290
Let's all get that baton to the finish line!

00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:01.360
Of course!

00:17:01.730 --> 00:17:02.560
Right!

00:17:03.520 --> 00:17:05.190
We'll do this together!

00:17:07.600 --> 00:17:12.060
Damn you, Precure! This isn't over yet-oni!

00:17:14.450 --> 00:17:15.880
You can do it!

00:17:15.880 --> 00:17:17.540
On your marks!

00:17:21.480 --> 00:17:22.230
Akane!

00:17:22.230 --> 00:17:22.790
Hino-san!

00:17:23.910 --> 00:17:24.820
Get set!

00:17:28.230 --> 00:17:31.510
The second-year girls' relay has just begun.

00:17:31.510 --> 00:17:32.420
Akane!

00:17:32.420 --> 00:17:33.720
Akane-chan!

00:17:34.120 --> 00:17:36.160
Pass... the baton!

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:38.850
The purple team is currently leading.

00:17:38.230 --> 00:17:39.460
Akane!

00:17:40.020 --> 00:17:41.860
Miyuki!

00:17:42.240 --> 00:17:42.730
Right!

00:17:44.090 --> 00:17:44.670
Alright!

00:17:44.670 --> 00:17:47.480
Whoa, they're in second?! Go on!

00:17:47.480 --> 00:17:48.370
Miyuki!

00:17:55.740 --> 00:17:57.110
Reika-chan!

00:17:57.110 --> 00:17:58.080
Right!

00:18:01.490 --> 00:18:05.890
Legs high! Arms wide! And move forward!

00:18:06.320 --> 00:18:10.560
The purple team are currently in the lead, followed by red.

00:18:09.370 --> 00:18:10.560
Aoki-san!

00:18:10.910 --> 00:18:14.160
Whoa! We're still in second!

00:18:15.430 --> 00:18:16.700
Yayoi!

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:18.490
We all believe in ya!

00:18:18.490 --> 00:18:20.010
Yayoi-chan!

00:18:20.010 --> 00:18:22.700
The fourth runners now have the baton.

00:18:23.510 --> 00:18:24.680
Yayoi-san!

00:18:26.390 --> 00:18:30.850
Green, blue, and yellow are catching up to red...

00:18:33.600 --> 00:18:35.320
Now we're down to fifth...

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:43.230
I won't give up! I'll get this baton to her!

00:19:03.810 --> 00:19:06.920
You can do it, Kise!

00:19:07.210 --> 00:19:10.040
You're so toast if you lose!

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:12.450
Go get 'em, Kise!

00:19:14.430 --> 00:19:15.470
Yayoi-chan!

00:19:15.470 --> 00:19:16.220
Yayoi!

00:19:16.220 --> 00:19:16.990
You can do it!

00:19:22.690 --> 00:19:23.660
That's it!

00:19:23.660 --> 00:19:24.500
Awesome!

00:19:30.350 --> 00:19:31.630
Nao-chan!

00:19:33.550 --> 00:19:34.630
Yayoi-chan!

00:19:35.520 --> 00:19:37.230
You were great!

00:19:38.710 --> 00:19:40.280
The five of us...

00:19:41.380 --> 00:19:44.720
Working together...

00:19:51.450 --> 00:19:52.700
Whoa...

00:19:56.360 --> 00:19:57.740
Just one more left...

00:19:59.850 --> 00:20:02.570
The red team is catching up to the purple team...

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:03.740
Nao...

00:20:04.740 --> 00:20:05.710
Nao-chan!

00:20:15.680 --> 00:20:18.520
Nao-chan!

00:21:03.430 --> 00:21:06.030
I'm so sorry...

00:21:07.200 --> 00:21:08.370
It's all my fault...

00:21:08.370 --> 00:21:09.630
Nao-chan!

00:21:09.630 --> 00:21:10.760
Nao-chan...!

00:21:10.760 --> 00:21:11.900
Nao!

00:21:14.230 --> 00:21:16.180
Nao! Nao!

00:21:16.180 --> 00:21:19.380
You were amazing! You were totally amazing!

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:24.620
I'm so glad... I'm so glad I didn't give up!

00:21:24.620 --> 00:21:28.320
In the end, the baton did connect us all.

00:21:35.850 --> 00:21:40.300
I'm so glad I got to run with you all.

00:21:41.350 --> 00:21:45.170
Nao! Nao!

00:23:39.540 --> 00:23:41.560
My name's Kise Yayoi.

00:23:41.920 --> 00:23:43.960
That's the name my dad gave me!

00:23:43.960 --> 00:23:47.200
My dad, so tall and gentle...

00:23:47.200 --> 00:23:50.970
However, I can't seem to remember him.

00:23:50.970 --> 00:23:54.900
I should remember all the times we played together...

00:23:54.900 --> 00:23:55.970
So why?

00:23:57.000 --> 00:23:58.570
Smile Precure:

00:24:02.030 --> 00:24:04.510
Find your ultra happy smile!
